@startuml
title GeoVisLM Terrain Pipeline Sequence

actor "Dashboard User" as User
participant "Dashboard UI / API" as Dashboard
participant "Auth + Project Access" as Auth
database "Shared Storage" as Storage
queue "File-Backed Job Queue" as Jobs
participant "Worker Loop" as Worker
participant "Analysis Adapter" as Adapter
participant "GIS Terrain Module" as Terrain
participant "Report Generator" as Reports
database "Artifacts" as Artifacts

User -> Dashboard: sign in / open project
Dashboard -> Auth: verify session and membership
Auth --> Dashboard: principal

User -> Dashboard: create run and upload DEM/vector inputs
Dashboard -> Storage: persist project, run, inputs
Dashboard -> Jobs: create queued job JSON
Dashboard --> User: run queued

Worker -> Jobs: poll and claim queued job
Jobs --> Worker: run_id + paths
Worker -> Storage: read run metadata and inputs
Worker -> Adapter: execute analysis for run

Adapter -> Terrain: load DEM
Terrain --> Adapter: DEM array, profile, transform, CRS
Adapter -> Terrain: calculate slope
Terrain --> Adapter: slope raster
Adapter -> Terrain: calculate hillshade
Terrain --> Adapter: hillshade raster
Adapter -> Terrain: classify terrain risk
Terrain --> Adapter: terrain risk raster

Adapter -> Artifacts: write maps, vectors, renders, logs
Adapter -> Reports: build Markdown summary
Reports -> Artifacts: write report.md

Worker -> Storage: update run/job status and artifact registry
Dashboard -> Storage: list outputs and report
Dashboard --> User: completed run with downloadable artifacts

@enduml
